  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  CLI->>GW: node:list
  %%> Command:
  %%> - `orbit node:list`
  %%> - syntax: `orbit node:list`
  alt caller has access
    %% path: authorized
    alt Gateway authority
      %% path: gateway-authority
      Note over GW: Read all Nodes
      %%> Requirements:
      %%> - the caller is the active Gateway Node, the serving host, or has an access grant to the active Gateway Node
    else direct access grants
      %% path: granted-nodes
      Note over GW: Read granted Nodes
      %%> What it does:
      %%> - filters by the calling Node's access grants; being a Node does not by itself grant access to its own record
    end
    GW-->>CLI: Recorded Nodes
    %%> Result:
    %%> - ordered by name, then ID, with recorded agent liveness
    %%> - reads no Node and creates no Operation; an unreachable Node remains in the list
    %%> Retry:
    %%> - another call reads the current records again; there is no mutation or partial change to resume
  else no authority or grants
    %% path: no-access
    GW--xCLI: node_access.required
    %%> Result:
    %%> - refuses the collection read without changing records
  end
